The Ruberto Lab welcomes Valentina Travaglini ’29 and Lukas Lee ’30, who are joining us through Florida State University’s Undergraduate Research Opportunity Program (UROP)!

Both Valentina and Lukas are pursuing degrees in Biological Sciences and will gain hands-on research experience while contributing to ongoing projects in the lab.

We look forward to working with them as they develop their research skills, explore their scientific interests, and contribute to the lab’s research efforts.
